{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04484","headline":"和陆明府赠将军重出塞 · 陈子昂","name":"和陆明府赠将军重出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽闻天上将，关塞重横行。\n始返楼兰国，还向朔方城。\n黄金装战马，白羽集神兵。\n星月开天阵，山川列地营。\n晚风吹画角，春色耀飞旌。\n宁知班定远，犹是一书生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"韩理洲"}